":"### Tested versions\n\nPresent: 4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\nNot present: 4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.14 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe behavior of the word joiner character, [wj] in bbcode, is different when attempting to connect text to an image.\n\nGodot 4.6\n<img width=\"667\" height=\"322\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b93e107c-905a-47fc-8bda-d7c658fe240a\" />\n\nGodot 4.5\n<img width=\"672\" height=\"377\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1be9912-97ef-4f2b-85b6-e45b9a1b6ba2\" />\n\nThe one in Godot 4.5 is the expected behavior in my opinion.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the provided project in both Godot 4.5 and 4.6 and resizing the RichTextLabel to observe the effects on line breaking.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[word_joiner_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25093566/word_joiner_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.g